# Wave W17-O (Route 113): ash drift — a banked drift of Smokestack ash standing on the road’s verge where the fall collects: a smooth grey mound in the snowdrift form, soft-shaded, its crest pale where the light takes it and its foot already spilling back onto the grass (design: ash drifts banked along the road; the shipped map carries no fence kind, so the drifts bank on the verge grass against the ashground patches — recorded honestly in the checklist). On sweep turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — the fleet’s only drift prop in the ash register, split from Yamato’s snowdrift by hue (warm grey ash, not snow).
